  "contract": [
    "Push every HLS segment through the media reader in 1-, 188- and 4096-byte windows. Also push the AVC/AAC subset through the AVC/AAC segment reader at every window size. The reference caps its forward TS input reads at the same window size.",
    "Fold video in decode order with its 90 kHz PTS and DTS, random access, raster and complete feed bytes from the borrowed spans. A missing time uses a zero presence and zero value word.",
    "Fold AAC segment-reader clocks as exact presentation and decode rationals, anchor origin, 90 kHz tick and duration and complete ADTS bytes. For the media reader, fold the application presentation time and duration in nanoseconds and the complete audio bytes.",
    "Fold the maximum video PTS and the final audio presentation (90 kHz for the segment reader, nanoseconds for the media reader) and clean end. Input loading is outside the operation. Refusal is a single kind 8 record."
  ],
